translate zh strings:

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/logic_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:27
    old "Let Yarrick set up the fight"
    new "让亚里克安排战斗"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/logic_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:27
    old "I have talked to Yarrick after reaching the Sun Forged rank at the Hamun arena. Now he wants to set up a special fight for me, which will surely attract Lord Zanzibat's attention.\nHe said it will take three days."
    new "我在哈穆恩竞技场达到烈日铸魂等级后与亚里克谈过了。现在他想为我安排一场特殊战斗，这肯定会吸引赞兹巴特勋爵的注意。\n他说需要三天时间。"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/logic_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:27
    old "Defeat the Caltrack"
    new "击败卡尔特拉克"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/logic_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:27
    old "The special battle Yarrick had set up for me is against a monstrous being, Caltrack. Time to earn us an audience..."
    new "亚里克为我安排的特别战斗是对抗一个名为卡尔特拉克的怪物。是时候为我们赢得会面机会了..."

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/logic_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:57
    old "Talk to Yarrick"
    new "与亚里克交谈"

translate zh strings:

