    old "Return to Yarrick"
    new "返回找亚里克"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/logic_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:27
    old "I have defeated the monster Yarrick set me up against. That should get us an audience with Zanzibat."
    new "我已击败亚里克为我安排的怪物。这应该能让我们获得与赞兹巴特会面的机会。"

