    old "Sypha has invited me on a 'date' in the night market in return for information... I should be careful, who knows what she's planning?"
    new "希法邀请我在夜市进行一场'约会'作为交换信息的回报...我应该小心点，谁知道她在计划什么？"

    # game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/logic_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:87
    old "Talk to Garen"
